# The build context of deploy/container/Dockerfile, which copies it whole to /opt/flatshare: the files the image and
# its entrypoint use, at their paths in the repository, and nothing else (python/flatshare_vllm/tests/test_container.py
# holds both ways).
*
!python/flatshare_vllm/src/flatshare_vllm/
!deploy/phastform/engine.yaml
!deploy/phastform/serving.json
!deploy/bin/serving-check
!deploy/container/serve.py
**/__pycache__
